## Advanced Troubleshooting Patterns

| Issue | Resolution Approach |
|-------|---------------------|
| Component re-rendering too often | Check memo usage and dependency arrays |
| Context performance issues | Implement context splitting or selector pattern |
| Complex state management bugs | Use reducer pattern with strict action types |
| API integration issues | Implement proper error boundaries and fallbacks |
| Type errors in complex components | Use more specific generic types and utility types |
| Performance bottlenecks | Implement code splitting and lazy loading |
| Memory leaks | Ensure proper cleanup in useEffect hooks |

